REMARK FACET backbone torsion angle prediction
REMARK https://github.com/maxzinke/facet-nmr

VARS   RESID RESNAME PHI PSI DPHI DPSI SS CHI1 CLASS
FORMAT %4d %s %8.1f %8.1f %6.1f %6.1f %s %s %s

    1 M   -125.7    149.5   21.1   14.1 C  g- Medium
    2 Q    -75.2    -25.6   14.6   18.6 C  g- Medium
    3 I    -67.2    -35.0   12.9    8.0 H  g+ High
    4 F    -69.5    -40.2   11.1   12.2 H   t High
    5 V    -69.1    -35.4   11.6   10.4 H   t High
    6 K    -65.0    -35.3    6.2    6.7 H   t High
    7 T    -69.0    -37.6   10.3   13.0 H  g+ Medium
    8 L    -61.3    -44.9   10.2   11.9 H   t High
    9 T    -66.3    -33.4   10.3   10.1 H  g+ High
   10 G    -73.6    -35.1   13.5   12.5 H   . Medium
